WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Meet Caspy, a tiny ghost with a big personality and a very precious candy basket. Your mission? Charm him into sharing.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Open The Heist and choose Start a demo heist. This preview needs no wallet, payment, or real transaction.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Your words are the magic. Tell a story, offer a trade, or try some humor. Then send your prompt.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Read Caspy's reply and build on your story. You have three chances. Choose your demo ending before the first prompt.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A Treat celebrates a sweet victory. A Trick remembers a brave attempt. In the demo, your preview selection decides the ending.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Open your result, choose Claim, then Simulate claim. Watch the confirmation appear. This preview creates no transaction or real NFT.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
That's Caspy. A little spooky, very stubborn, and waiting for your best story. Ready to try your own little heist?

